    "text": "\"Two particles $A$ and $B$ are moving as shown. in the figure.\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/2015_phy_q17.png\">\r\nTheir total angular momentum about the point $O$ is",
