  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Total angular momentum about $O$ is given as,\r\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n\\mathbf{L} &=\\mathbf{L}_{1}+\\mathbf{L}_{2}=m_{1} V_{1} I_{1}+m_{2} V_{2} I_{2} \\\\\r\n&=-6.5 \\times 2.2 \\times 1.5+3.1 \\times 3.6 \\times 2.8 \\\\\r\n&=-21.45+31.248=9.8 \\mathrm{kgm}^{2} / \\mathrm{s}\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$",
